# Brave the Wilds, bargained, on a land that is already a creature: "becomes a 3/3 Elemental creature with haste that's still a land"
# adds the type and subtype without taking away the ones it has (CR 205.1b, 613.1d). Mishra's Factory, animated into a 2/2
# Assembly-Worker artifact creature until end of turn, becomes a 3/3 (the later timestamp, CR 613.7) that is both an Assembly-Worker
# and an Elemental; once the Factory's own change ends at cleanup it is a 3/3 Elemental land creature, no longer an artifact.

